array -- collection of elements with same or different types
push -- will add element at the end
pop -- will delete element at the end
unshift -- will add element at begining
shift -- will delete element at begining
includes -- will check in array whether element present or not if it is present return true
join -- will convert array into string based on deliberator
reverse -- will reverse the elements -- call by reference
forEach -- will walk through array but not returns any value
map -- will return all values if condition is not matching it returns undefined (array length doesn't change)
filter -- will filter values based on condition (array length will change)